## Workflow
This repo uses the agentic-workflow plugin. Typical loop:

```
/discover → /plan-feature → /decompose → build → /code-structure → /review-loop
                                                        ↘ /document-architecture
                                                        ↘ /architecture-review
                                                        ↘ /create-pr → /review-pr → /pr-review-loop
                                                        ↘ /handoff (before clearing)
```

Use `/architecture-review` after `/document-architecture` (or once `docs/architecture/` exists)
to flag drift in a diff against the documented architecture.

| Command | Phase | Does |
|---|---|---|
| `/discover` | Discovery | Build shared understanding; refuses to code |
| `/plan-feature` | Plan | Write a risk-first plan to `plan/<feature>.md` |
| `/decompose` | Plan | Split a plan into stacked PRs (<1,000 lines each) |
| `/decompose-to-userstories` | Plan | Turn plan + stacked PRs into JIRA-ready EPICs and user stories in `plan/` |
| `/code-structure` | Build | Dedupe → service layer; enforce domain isolation |
| `/review-loop` | Review | Review → fix → re-test until clean and green |
| `/enterprise-review` | Review | Deep principles audit (DDD, modularity, dependency hygiene, OO, security); verdict per dimension, advisory |
| `/create-pr` | Review | Open GitHub PR; write `plan/<slug>.pr-review.md` |
| `/review-pr` | Review | Score PR 0–5 (min of 8 dims); post PR comment |
| `/pr-review-loop` | Review | Confirm each iteration; fix, push, re-review until 5/5 or cap |
| `/document-architecture` | Any | C4 L1/L2/L3 + deployment, integrations, data flow |
| `/architecture-review` | Review | Flag drift in a diff vs. `docs/architecture/` |
| `/handoff` | Any | Persist context to disk before clearing a thread |

Slash commands load natively in each harness after bootstrap:
- **Claude Code:** `.claude/commands/engineer/<name>.md` — loaded as namespaced project
  commands. Type `/engineer` and tab-complete the group: `/engineer:discover`,
  `/engineer:plan-feature`, `/engineer:decompose`, … No `/plugin install` needed.
- **Cursor:** unnamespaced (`/discover`, `/plan-feature`, …) from the installed plugin
  (`~/.cursor/plugins/local/agentic-workflow/`); `.cursor/commands/<name>.md` are
  reference symlinks for browsing.

The workflow table above uses the short names; in Claude Code prefix them with
`engineer:` (e.g. `/discover` → `/engineer:discover`).
- **Plugin link-backs:** `.claude/agentic-workflow-plugin/` and
  `.cursor/agentic-workflow-plugin/` — symlinked by bootstrap.

## Frontend workflow (Vue/Vite SPA repos)

For SPA repos there is a parallel `frontend` command set.

### Project map (fill in per project)
